#. ja: クリスタライト
#. de: kosmisch[a] Kristallit
#. fr: morceau de cristallite cosmique
#. column 2: chunks of cosmic crystallite
#. column 8: This extremely rare form of crystal-based achondrite is infused with aether from its journey through the cosmos. Theoretically, its energies can be extracted in the form of a highly refined liquid essence.
#. column 9: Cosmic Crystallite
msgctxt "Item:41032:0:0"
msgid "chunk of cosmic crystallite"
msgstr "кусок космического кристаллита"

#. de: kosmisch[a] Kristallite
#. fr: morceaux de cristallite cosmique
#. column 0: chunk of cosmic crystallite
#. column 8: This extremely rare form of crystal-based achondrite is infused with aether from its journey through the cosmos. Theoretically, its energies can be extracted in the form of a highly refined liquid essence.
#. column 9: Cosmic Crystallite
msgctxt "Item:41032:0:2"
msgid "chunks of cosmic crystallite"
msgstr "куски космического кристаллита"

#. ja: 大変希少な輝石で構成されたエイコンドライトの一種。エーテル伝導率を変化させる、とても紳士的で特別な鉱物油が抽出できる
#. de: Diese extrem seltene Form des Achondrits wurde auf seiner Reise durch den Kosmos mit einer hohen Konzentration an Äther aufgeladen. Mithilfe einer speziellen Technik kann aus ihm eine äußerst wertvolle Essenz gewonnen werden.
#. fr: Une variété d'achondrite par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement rare. Ses propriétés de conduction éthéréenne sont sûrement les plus <i>balèzes</i> de l'univers.
#. column 0: chunk of cosmic crystallite
#. column 2: chunks of cosmic crystallite
#. column 9: Cosmic Crystallite
msgctxt "Item:41032:0:8"
msgid "This extremely rare form of crystal-based achondrite is infused with aether from its journey through the cosmos. Theoretically, its energies can be extracted in the form of a highly refined liquid essence."
msgstr "Это крайне редкая разновидность кристаллического ахондрита, пропитанного эфиром за время странствий по космосу. Теоретически из него можно извлечь энергию в виде высокоочищенной жидкой эссенции."

#. ja: クリスタライト
