#. ja: ラヴィリンソス・グレープランプポスト
#. de: Labyrinthos-Traubenlaterne
#. fr: réverbère grappe de raisins du Labyrinthos
#. column 2: Labyrinthos grape lampposts
#. column 8: Seeking to make grapes more transportable, a researcher at Meryall Agronomics is rumored to have produced a variety that grew in blocky clusters. Although complaints that they looked unappetizing led to a new strain with rounder edges, the original was regarded fondly by some, and so it was immortalized in the form of this lamppost.
#. column 9: Labyrinthos Grape Lamppost
msgctxt "Item:41145:0:0"
msgid "Labyrinthos grape lamppost"
msgstr "виноградный уличный фонарь Лабиринтоса"

#. de: Labyrinthos-Traubenlaternen
#. fr: réverbères grappe de raisins du Labyrinthos
#. column 0: Labyrinthos grape lamppost
#. column 8: Seeking to make grapes more transportable, a researcher at Meryall Agronomics is rumored to have produced a variety that grew in blocky clusters. Although complaints that they looked unappetizing led to a new strain with rounder edges, the original was regarded fondly by some, and so it was immortalized in the form of this lamppost.
#. column 9: Labyrinthos Grape Lamppost
msgctxt "Item:41145:0:2"
msgid "Labyrinthos grape lampposts"
msgstr "виноградные уличные фонари Лабиринтоса"

#. ja: メリオール実験農場でかつて栽培されていた、独特な形状のブドウを象ったステンドグラス街灯
#. de: Eine Straßenlaterne aus Buntglass, entwickelt in Erinnerung an die ungewöhnlich geformten Trauben, welche einst in Meryalls Agrarbotanik gezüchtet wurden.
#. fr: La lampe de ce réverbère reproduit à l'identique la forme des grappes de raisins autrefois cultivées au laboratoire agronomique de Meryall.
#. column 0: Labyrinthos grape lamppost
#. column 2: Labyrinthos grape lampposts
#. column 9: Labyrinthos Grape Lamppost
msgctxt "Item:41145:0:8"
msgid "Seeking to make grapes more transportable, a researcher at Meryall Agronomics is rumored to have produced a variety that grew in blocky clusters. Although complaints that they looked unappetizing led to a new strain with rounder edges, the original was regarded fondly by some, and so it was immortalized in the form of this lamppost."
msgstr "Говорят, исследователь из Агрономии Мерьялла вывел сорт винограда с угловатыми гроздьями, чтобы его было проще перевозить. Многие сочли такие ягоды невкусными на вид, и сорт заменили другим, с более округлыми гроздями. Но некоторым прежний виноград полюбился, и его увековечили в виде этого фонаря."

