msgstr "Тень мёртвого дерева"

#. ja: ロンカブリオン
#. de: Ronka-Bullion
#. fr: lingot ronka
#. column 2: Ronkan bullions
#. column 8: Due to its gilded scales and massive girth, this inhabitant of Mjrl's Tears is thought to be an ancient Ronkan treasure, transformed into a living creature.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Ronkan Bullion
msgctxt "Item:41299:0:0"
msgid "Ronkan bullion"
msgstr "ронканский слиток"

