#. ja: 聖ファスリクの石頭
#. de: Fathric-Steinkopf
#. fr: obstination de Saint-Fathric
#. column 2: Saint Fathric's faces
#. column 8: This hulking creature's unnaturally sturdy head and stubborn nature won it the namesake of a famed Voeburtite saint.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
