msgctxt "Item:41409:0:9"
msgid "Snowy Parexus"
msgstr "Снежный парексус"

#. ja: フルカカウダ
#. de: Furcacauda
#. fr: furcacauda
#. column 2: Furcacaudas
#. column 8: Named for its forked tail, this elusive inhabitant of Lethe sports a remarkable bone structure rarely found among wavekin.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 1 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Furcacauda
msgctxt "Item:41410:0:0"
msgid "Furcacauda"
msgstr "Фуркакауда"

