#. fr: fève kukuru sublimée
#. column 2: sublime kukuru beans
#. column 8: This wondrous kukuru bean has gone from prime to sublime through a process you don't understand and aren't going to worry about. What's important is that it promises an impressive yield from aetherial reduction.
