#. column 2: sparkling citrus refreshments
#. column 8: Dehydrated adventurers, rejoice─this crisp, bubbly beverage boasts an invigorating citrus kick that will thoroughly quench one's thirst on the road. Guaranteed to make even the most arduous trials feel like a tropical vacation.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>EXP Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4%  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30m<br>(Duration can be extended to 60m by consuming multiple servings)
